  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot of Market System Development and Value chain for Equatoria state.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this funding request, CTP proposes to engage a consultant who will conduct a thorough value chain analysis of groundnuts. This will also include market chain analysis of groundnut production and green beans in Western Equatoria. The findings and recommendations of the analysis shall provide guidance to CTP to engage a Facilitator who will training our Local Partner on market systems development and develop specific value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
